  _questionBody: Why should batteries not be mixed with regular household trash?
  _rightAnswer: They may contain materials that require special disposal.
  _wrongAnswer1: They take up too much space.
  _wrongAnswer2: They are too heavy for garbage trucks.
  _wrongAnswer3: They cannot fit inside trash bins.
